<html>
<head>

</head>
<body style="margin:10px 0 0 0;" bgcolor="#ffffff" color="#000000" leftmargin="0" topmargin="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0">
    <table width="686" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 11px; font-family: Tahoma, Helvetica;" rules="none">
        <tr height="124"><td align="center"><a href="<%= args['site'] %>/?<%= args['utms'] %>" style="color: #787878; font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;"><img alt="Luxury Store" src="<%= args['site'] %>/email_img/logo.png" width="220" height="64" /></a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr style="background: #ffffff;">
            <td style="height: 9px; width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="line-height: 41px; font-size: 41px; padding: 24px 0px;">
                <a target="_blank" style="color: #2b2b2b;font-family: Georgia,serif;font-size: 41px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 41px;text-align: center;text-decoration: none;text-transform: uppercase;" href="<%= args['site'] %>/catalog/?category=new_season&<%= args['utms'] %>"><%= args['subject'] %></a>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td width="58%" align="center" valign="top" style="padding: 0 0 40px 0;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#2b2b2b;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;">
                <%= args['content'] %>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td bgcolor="#cccccc" style="height: 1px; width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr><td height="40" style="font-size:1px;line-height:1px"></td></tr>
    </table>
    <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="padding: 40px 0 0 0;background-color:#f0f0f0;">
		<tr>
            <td align="center" width="100%" valign="top">
				<table>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="3" align="center" style="padding-bottom: 6px;">Приложения</td>
                    </tr>
					<tr>
						<td width="40" align="center">
                            <a title="apple_app" class="social apple" href="https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/internet-magazin-brendovoj/id913481541?ls=1&amp;mt=8">
                                <img border="0" width="32" height="32" src="<%= args['site'] %>/images/social/email_apple.png" />
                            </a>
						</td>
                        <td width="40" align="center">
                            <a title="android_app" class="social android" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.lsboutqiue.app">
                                <img border="0" width="32" height="32" src="<%= args['site'] %>/images/social/email_android.png" />
                            </a>
						</td>
<td width="120" align="center">
                            <a title="apple_wallet" class="social wallet" href="https://lsboutique.ru/pass/<%= args['user_phone_number'] %>/<%= args['user_card_number'] %>/?output">
                                <img border="0" width="116" height="32" src="<%= args['site'] %>/images/social/apple_wallet_long.png" />
                            </a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td>
        </tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="center" width="100%" valign="top">
				<table>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="5" align="center" style="padding-bottom: 6px;">Социальные группы</td>
                    </tr>
					<tr>
						<td width="22">
							<a title="Facebook" class="social fb" href="//www.facebook.com/lsboutiq/?ref=bookmarks">
								<img border="0" width="20" height="20" src="<%= args['site'] %>/images/social/email_facebook.png" />
							</a>
						</td>
						<td width="30">
							<a title="В контакте" class="social vk" href="//vk.com/lsboutiq">
								<img border="0" width="20" height="20" src="<%= args['site'] %>/images/social/email_vk.png" />
							</a>
						</td>
						<td width="30">
							<a title="Instagram" class="social instagram" href="//instagram.com/ls.boutique.ru/">
								<img border="0" width="20" height="20" src="<%= args['site'] %>/images/social/email_instagram.png" />
							</a>
						</td>
						<td width="30">
							<a  title="Telegram" class="social telegram" href="https://t.me/lsnetru">
								<img border="0" width="20" height="20" src="<%= args['site'] %>/images/social/email_telegram.png" />
							</a>
						</td>
						<td width="30">
							<a  title="Youtube" class="social ytub" href="//www.youtube.com/channel/UCLCtEXaZq_h2jAOfE2wtwFw">
								<img border="0" width="20" height="20" src="<%= args['site'] %>/images/social/email_youtube.png" />
							</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr><td height="25" style="font-size:1px;line-height:1px"></td></tr>
				</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="center" style="color: #2b2b2b;font-family: Georgia,serif;font-size: 14px;line-height: 28px;text-align: center;text-decoration: none;">
				<a href="mailto:<%= args['order_manager_email'] %>" style="color: #2b2b2b;font-size: 14px;line-height: 28px;text-decoration: none;">
					Это письмо было отправлено на <em><%= args['user_email'] %></em><br>
					Спасибо за Ваш интерес к интернет-магазину Лакшери Store.<br>
					Хорошего дня и хороших покупок!<br>
					С уважением, <span style="font-weight: bold;"><%= args['order_manager'] %></span> - руководитель службы Вашей поддержки <em><%= args['order_manager_email'] %></em>
				</a><br><br>
					Для того, чтобы наши сообщения не попадали в спам, пожалуйста, добавьте <em><%= args['order_manager_email'] %></em> в адресную книгу.
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr><td height="25" style="font-size:1px;line-height:1px"></td></tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="center" style="color: #999999;">&copy; Лакшери Store <%= Time.now.strftime("%Y") %></td>
		</tr>
		<tr><td height="25" style="font-size:1px;line-height:1px"></td></tr>
	</table>
</body>
</html>
